flowchart LR
  subgraph Repo[Untrusted repository boundary]
    AC[Assessment Contract v1]
    AR[Assessment Report v1]
  end

  subgraph Runner[Trusted execution boundary]
    VAL[Strict schema and policy validation]
    PRE[Canonical offline preview]
    GATE{External write enabled?}
    AUTH[Secret provider: OAuth token and optional client certificate]
    TX[Bounded transport: no redirects, TLS verify, allowlisted origin]
    REC[Read-back and reconciliation]
  end

  subgraph SN[ServiceNow trust boundary]
    CAP[Evidence Gateway capability endpoint]
    CAS[Server allowlist, unique delivery key and CAS]
    CHG[(Existing Change)]
    MODEL[Allowlisted Change Model]
    ATT[(Bounded evidence attachment)]
    CAB[CAB and Change workflow]
  end

  AC --> AR --> VAL --> PRE --> GATE
  GATE -- no / dry-run --> OUT[Local plan and DRY_RUN result]
  GATE -- yes + authorization --> AUTH --> TX --> CAP --> CAS
  CAS -- enrich-existing --> CHG
  MODEL -- create-draft only --> CAS
  CAS --> ATT
  CAS --> REC
  CHG -. remains authoritative .-> CAB
  REC -- verified --> RESULT[Auditable adapter result v2]
  REC -- conflict or unknown --> FAIL[Fail closed; no approval claim]
